Package: daffiz
Title: Numeric Regression Comparison for Tabular Data
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Pedro", "Baltazar", email = "pedrobtz@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"))
Description: Compares numeric measures in two tables that are expected to be
    nearly identical. Rows are aligned by inferred or explicitly selected
    identity columns, and differences remain traceable to the original row
    numbers in both inputs. Symmetric absolute and relative tolerances can be
    set globally or by measure. Results are returned as a long 'data.table'
    with one row per aligned numeric cell. Optional plots reveal how numeric
    differences are distributed across measures and source rows.
